# 5. NOBLE RNG FLOW

Setiap karakter menjalani proses:

```text
CHARACTER GENERATED
        ↓
STAR GENERATED
        ↓
CHECK STAR
        ↓
NOBLE RNG
        │
        ├── SUCCESS
        │      ↓
        │    NOBLE
        │      ↓
        │   FAMILY RNG
        │      ↓
        │   SECOND NAME RNG
        │      ↓
        │   NOBLE SKILL RNG
        │
        └── FAILED
               ↓
           NON-NOBLE
```

Contoh:

```text
Character:
Kael

Star:
⭐⭐⭐⭐

Noble Rate:
40%

RNG:
27

Result:
NOBLE
```

Karena:

```text
27 ≤ 40
```

maka karakter menjadi Noble.

